            "notes": "### Main\n\nRound 2 is where we can start building into Cooldown Reduction alongside Ability Power. Ability Lifesteal would come in handy as we expect the enemy team to also build on their damage output.\n\n### Note\n\n[Galvanized Core](item_08c03408-5597-4a0e-93a6-a8a36182e298)'s increased Boosters duration might seem useful, but unless you're intending to spec into a melee build, it is usually safer and more damage efficient to fly in, cause a distraction with the lava then stand aside and fire at the enemy team.",
