            "notes": "### Main\n\nHere we take [Stat Boost](item_d3ef725b-3183-417c-bc5a-76bfa21c6cc5) to give us better survivability while dive bombing and harassing the enemy team. It works really well given that we will be trying to use Boosters a lot, and then Defense Matrix once we've taken aggro. Note that if you use Defense Matrix with Boosters, you will not be able to recover Defense Matrix, and thus, won't be making full use of the power. So when you're flying in to lay your lava pools, try to do so not in line of sight of the heavy damage dealers of the enemy team. And try to end Boosters where your healers can easily and safely top you off (Matrix if needed). \n\nContinue stacking Ability Power. If you have earned a lot and running out of slots, feel free to take purple items. Or if you really need certain buffs/debuffs that purples give. Otherwise, blues and greens are typically more cash efficient than purples.\n\n### Note\n\nI don't usually take [Vesuvius Protocol](item_04b6ec44-8349-4e12-9ea7-a316bee18995) as I don't feel ultimate buffs are as impactful due to my playstyle. But you may take it if you play into a lot of melee heroes (Rein, JQ, Reaper, Genji, etc) as it gives 10% Ability Power and lava should land near you, protecting you for 10 seconds till you can get back in Meka. Note that it only applies when using your ultimate, and not when your Meka gets destroyed.",
