            "notes": "### Main\n\n[Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) for the 20% Ability Power and 10% Cooldown Reduction. 3s Overhealth when using ultimate is a nice bonus as it works both as Meka and baby Dva.\n\n[Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) gives us 10% Ability Power and 5% Cooldown Reduction. It's also useful against high healing output healers (Moira, Mercy, Lucio) or self-healing heroes (Junkerqueen, Reaper). Check their builds or press tab to see their healing stats to keep track.\n\n### Optional\n\n[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) gives pretty much constant 25% Ability Power if you are firing your Fusion Cannons before Boosters and Missiles.\n\nGet [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) for more sustain if needed. Healing 50 armor each time you use Boosters or Missiles is pretty good.",
