            "created_at": "2025-08-17T16:54:31.413052+00:00",
            "notes": "### Main\n\n[Overstocked](item_d6b946fd-0fd8-4ba1-85d0-601995136eb6) is taken for additional missile burst damage and pressure. It also helps you proc your ability usage items more often along with your low cooldown.\n\nAlways be spamming your weapon before lava bombing or firing missiles so that [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) gets the juicy max stacked 25% Ability Power.\n\n### Optional\n\n[MEKA Punch](item_70090fbf-a2ba-4b47-a3d9-1081546a3a47) instead of double missiles might be more useful against heroes who are more agile and hard to hit with the full blast of missiles. Since Boosters resets on meka punch eliminations (not killing blow, so you only need to get the booster punch in and any teammate/ability can clean up), it's even good against Kiriko clone builds to chase down the real Kiriko.\n\nMEKA Punch and [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) work well together, increasing melee damage and survivability when going up close and personal. MEKA Punch eliminations count even when your allies get the killing blow on the enemy. It will reset your Boosters as long as you melee'd the enemy while boosting through. Eliminations also seem to count Kiriko clones, Bob and Zarya's bubbles.\n\n[Onslaught Ordinance](item_aa2a5d6d-0f8f-4b27-a44e-331832ec11fa) for even more missile damage.\n\n[Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) is also useful to slow enemies while they retreat or push forward in your lava.\n\n[Busan Blaster](item_1995cee5-e752-40e5-b6c9-7f1c43531362) gives 20% Ability Power which is the same as [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), but $4000 more expensive while giving you a charged explosive secondary attack which pierces enemies and shields and scales on Ability Power. Situationally useful if you lose your meka a lot.",
