            "created_at": "2025-08-17T16:54:31.413052+00:00",
            "notes": "### Main\n\nTesting showed that [Legendary Loadout](item_81067d34-38fb-4057-9336-f387f75dfd5f) not scaling with AP bug was fixed. So it's viable for the higher burst damage. Or, you can take [Express Detonation](item_8da4cbad-78cb-4ebd-8bc4-8dc150afec95) to catch enemies off-guard with faster detonation, or [CounterMeasures](item_1a15e568-079c-4d1f-a7e5-37219bd9b87f) which does well in late game when everyone does more damage, or [Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8) for even more matrix uptime to stop damage spam expected in late game.\n \n[Onslaught Ordinance](item_aa2a5d6d-0f8f-4b27-a44e-331832ec11fa) for even more missile power.\n\n[Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) stacks well with your ability focused build, as it adds AP damage when you fire your weapon after an ability. So make sure to fire a burst each time you use missiles or boosters.\n\nIf you took [Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8), you may also want to consider swapping out the defensive items like [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) or [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) for more offensive items as you will probably take less damage.\n\n[Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) could also be good to build ult charge quickly to use your [Express Detonation](item_8da4cbad-78cb-4ebd-8bc4-8dc150afec95) more often.\n\n### Credit\n\nLegendary Loadout test Info from https://www.reddit.com/r/OverwatchUniversity/comments/1leei34/legendary_loadout_tested_dvas_big_rockets/",
